WEBVTT

00:01:57.829 --> 00:02:03.746
Situations involving probability are
notoriously bad for applying heuristics.

00:02:04.079 --> 00:02:08.704
For instance, say you were to roll a die
with four green faces and two red faces

00:02:08.746 --> 00:02:10.371
twenty times.

00:02:10.413 --> 00:02:12.996
You can choose one
of the following sequences of rolls,

00:02:13.038 --> 00:02:15.621
and if it shows up,
you'll win $25.

00:02:15.663 --> 00:02:17.746
Which would you pick?

00:02:18.579 --> 00:02:22.871
In one study, 65% of the participants
who were all college students

00:02:22.913 --> 00:02:24.413
chose sequence B

00:02:24.454 --> 00:02:27.663
even though A is shorter
and contained within B,

00:02:27.704 --> 00:02:29.788
in other words, more likely.